Subject: Munich Newcomers Weekly #37: Tandem Tuesdays + Lantern walk

Servus everyone,

two tips this week:

1) TANDEM TUESDAYS
Our favourite language café is still going strong. Every Tuesday from 7pm at
Café Lindwurm (Hohenzollernstr. 41, Schwabing). Free, you just buy a drink.
Great if you're nervous about speaking German - nobody judges.

2) LANTERN WALK THROUGH THE ENGLISCHER GARTEN
One night only: Saturday 21 November, 5:30pm, meeting at the Chinesischer Turm.
Tickets 12 EUR on our website.

Have a lovely week,
the Newcomers Weekly team
